### Valid Puck Block Types

When creating page content, use ONLY these block types:

| Category | Blocks |
|----------|--------|
| Layout | Grid, Flex, Container, Space, Divider |
| Typography | Heading, Text |
| Actions | Button, LinkBlock |
| Templates | Hero, Card, Logos, Stats |
| Data | DataBlock, TableBlock, MetricBlock, ChartBlock, FormBlock |
| Fields* | TextField, NumberField, BooleanField, DateField, SelectField, ImageField, FileField, DocumentField, RelationField, LinkField |
| Structure | HeaderBlock, FooterBlock |
| Content | EditorBlock, MarkdownBlock |
| Logic | ConditionalBlock |
| Auth | LoginBlock, SignOutBlock |

*Field blocks must be inside a DataBlock

**NEVER invent block types!** Use exact names from this list.
- WRONG: "HeroSection", "FeatureCards", "CallToAction"
- CORRECT: "Hero", "Card", "Button"

